#: upses.php
msgid "The physical location of the Device.  This free form text can be a room, rack location, etc."
msgstr "Die fisiese ligging van die toestel. Hierdie vryvormteks kan 'n kamer, rakligging, ens. wees."

#: upses.php
msgid "Cacti Device"
msgstr "Cacti-toestel"

#: upses.php
msgid "For SNMP Based UPS', select the Cacti Device to use for SNMP credentials.  Otherwise, select None, and the UPS plugin will create the Device for you automatically."
msgstr "Vir SNMP-gebaseerde UPS'e, kies die Cacti-toestel om vir SNMP-aanmeldbewyse te gebruik. Andersins, kies Geen, en die UPS-inprop sal die toestel outomaties vir jou skep."

#: upses.php
msgid "Autocreate on First Poll"
msgstr "Skep outomaties by eerste peiling"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Geaktiveer"

#: upses.php
msgid "Check to immediately start polling for data."
msgstr "Merk om onmiddellik vir data te begin peil."

#: upses.php
msgid "APC UPSD Information"
msgstr "APC UPSD-inligting"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname of the host running apcupsd or the NUT server (upsd)."
msgstr "Die gasheernaam van die gasheer wat apcupsd of die NUT-bediener (upsd) laat loop."

#: upses.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "TCP-poort"

#: upses.php
msgid "Enter the TCP Port for this UPS.  apcupsd defaults to 3551 and NUT defaults to 3493."
msgstr "Voer die TCP-poort vir hierdie UPS in. apcupsd gebruik standaard 3551 en NUT gebruik standaard 3493."

#: upses.php
msgid "Timeout (seconds)"
msgstr "Uitteltyd (sekondes)"

#: upses.php
msgid "How long the poller waits for apcupsd or the NUT server before giving up on this UPS, from 1 to 120 seconds.  SNMP based UPS's use the SNMP timeout instead."
msgstr "Hoe lank die peiler vir apcupsd of die NUT-bediener wag voordat dit op hierdie UPS tou opgooi, van 1 tot 120 sekondes. SNMP-gebaseerde UPS'e gebruik eerder die SNMP-uitteltyd."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Options"
msgstr "NUT-opsies"

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT UPS Name"
msgstr "NUT UPS-naam"

#: upses.php
msgid "The name of the UPS on the NUT server, as listed by \"upsc -l\" (the part before the @ in ups@host).  One NUT server can serve several UPSes."
msgstr "Die naam van die UPS op die NUT-bediener, soos gelys deur \"upsc -l\" (die deel voor die @ in ups@host). Een NUT-bediener kan verskeie UPS'e bedien."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Username"
msgstr "NUT-gebruikersnaam"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The upsd.users account to authenticate with.  Leave blank for anonymous read-only access, which is how NUT servers are usually monitored."
msgstr "Opsioneel. Die upsd.users-rekening om mee te staaf. Laat leeg vir anonieme leesalleentoegang, wat die gewone manier is waarop NUT-bedieners gemonitor word."

#: upses.php
msgid "NUT Password"
msgstr "NUT-wagwoord"

#: upses.php
msgid "The password for the NUT Username."
msgstr "Die wagwoord vir die NUT-gebruikersnaam."

#: upses.php
msgid "Use TLS (STARTTLS)"
msgstr "Gebruik TLS (STARTTLS)"

#: upses.php
msgid "Encrypt the connection with STARTTLS before any credentials are sent.  The NUT server certificate and host name are verified, so the certificate must be trusted by the Cacti poller, or you can point to its CA / certificate file below."
msgstr "Enkripteer die verbinding met STARTTLS voordat enige aanmeldbewyse gestuur word. Die NUT-bedienersertifikaat en gasheernaam word geverifieer, dus moet die sertifikaat deur die Cacti-peiler vertrou word, of jy kan hieronder na sy CA- / sertifikaatlêer verwys."

#: upses.php
msgid "CA / Certificate File"
msgstr "CA- / sertifikaatlêer"

#: upses.php
msgid "Optional.  The full path on the Cacti poller to a PEM file holding the CA certificate (or the self-signed server certificate) to verify the NUT server against, for example /etc/nut/upsd.pem.  The host name above must match the certificate."
msgstr "Opsioneel. Die volledige pad op die Cacti-peiler na 'n PEM-lêer wat die CA-sertifikaat (of die selfondertekende bedienersertifikaat) bevat om die NUT-bediener teen te verifieer, byvoorbeeld /etc/nut/upsd.pem. Die gasheernaam hierbo moet by die sertifikaat pas."

#: upses.php
msgid "Allow Self-Signed Certificate"
msgstr "Laat selfondertekende sertifikaat toe"

#: upses.php
msgid "Accept any certificate without checking it.  The connection is still encrypted, but the NUT server is not authenticated, so a man-in-the-middle could read the NUT credentials.  Prefer the CA / Certificate File above."
msgstr "Aanvaar enige sertifikaat sonder om dit na te gaan. Die verbinding is steeds geënkripteer, maar die NUT-bediener word nie gestaaf nie, dus kan 'n tussenganger die NUT-aanmeldbewyse lees. Verkies die CA- / sertifikaatlêer hierbo."

#: upses.php
msgid "SNMP Options"
msgstr "SNMP-opsies"

#: upses.php
msgid "The hostname where the snmp agent is located."
msgstr "Die gasheernaam waar die SNMP-agent geleë is."

#: upses.php
msgid "The Poller ID cannot be changed while the UPS is linked to a Cacti Device.  Change the poller on the device instead."
msgstr "Die Peiler-ID kan nie verander word terwyl die UPS aan 'n Cacti-toestel gekoppel is nie. Verander eerder die peiler op die toestel."

#: upses.php
msgid "Template UPS was not found! Unable to duplicate."
msgstr "Sjabloon-UPS is nie gevind nie! Kan nie dupliseer nie."

#: upses.php
msgid "None of the selected UPSes has a Cacti Device yet, so Graph Automation was not run.  A device is created on the first successful poll."
msgstr "Geen van die gekose UPS'e het nog 'n Cacti-toestel nie, dus is grafiekoutomatisering nie uitgevoer nie. 'n Toestel word met die eerste suksesvolle peiling geskep."

#: upses.php
#, php-format
msgid "Graph Automation was run for %d UPS(es).  %d UPS(es) have no Cacti Device yet and were skipped."
msgstr "Grafiekoutomatisering is vir %d UPS('e) uitgevoer. %d UPS('e) het nog geen Cacti-toestel nie en is oorgeslaan."

#: upses.php
#, php-format
msgid "Graph Automation was run for %d UPS(es)."
msgstr "Grafiekoutomatisering is vir %d UPS('e) uitgevoer."

#: upses.php
msgid "(no Cacti Device yet)"
msgstr "(nog geen Cacti-toestel nie)"

