#: upses.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to run Graph Automation for the following UPS.  Graphs, data sources and tree items are created from the device's templates and the matching automation rules; graphs that already exist are left as they are.  Only a UPS that already has a Cacti Device is affected."
msgid_plural "Click 'Continue' to run Graph Automation for the following UPSes.  Graphs, data sources and tree items are created from each device's templates and the matching automation rules; graphs that already exist are left as they are.  Only a UPS that already has a Cacti Device is affected."
msgstr[0] "Klik 'Gaan voort' om grafiekoutomatisering vir die volgende UPS uit te voer. Grafieke, databronne en boomitems word geskep uit die toestel se sjablone en die ooreenstemmende outomatiseringsreëls; grafieke wat reeds bestaan, word gelaat soos hulle is. Slegs 'n UPS wat reeds 'n Cacti-toestel het, word geraak."
msgstr[1] "Klik 'Gaan voort' om grafiekoutomatisering vir die volgende UPS'e uit te voer. Grafieke, databronne en boomitems word geskep uit elke toestel se sjablone en die ooreenstemmende outomatiseringsreëls; grafieke wat reeds bestaan, word gelaat soos hulle is. Slegs 'n UPS wat reeds 'n Cacti-toestel het, word geraak."

